reviewer_concerns.value:
(i) The missing SDTT comparison and relationship were directly handled via an added SDTT table and clearer discussion, with strong numbers in favor of FS-DFM; 
(ii) requests for broader diffusion/flow baselines were partially addressed by adding SEDD/MDLM/ReMDM/HDLM comparisons (at least at 8 steps) and adding MAUVE reporting versus strong diffusion LMs; 
(iii) clarity concerns around objective/notation and entropy analysis were addressed by adding derivational context/citations and providing additional entropy-vs.-NFE plots plus an explanation tied to intrinsic dataset entropy; 
(iv) reviewer questions about EMA-teacher rationale and solver fidelity were answered and framed as design trade-offs/future directions.
